@*
    What the colours of the calendar mean. A date is also marked by an icon and a word in the schedule (the colour is never the only sign), the legend names them once.
*@
<ul class="np-legend" aria-label="Legende">
    <li><span class="np-chip np-chip--soft">Todo offen</span></li>
    <li><span class="np-chip np-chip--busy">Todo in Arbeit, Schlüsselergebnis</span></li>
    <li><span class="np-chip np-chip--ok">erledigt, erreicht</span></li>
    <li><span class="np-chip np-chip--error">überfällig oder blockiert</span></li>
    <li><span class="np-chip np-chip--accent">Meilenstein, Projektende</span></li>
    <li><span class="np-chip np-chip--warn">Review</span></li>
</ul>
